    "text": "<p>Torque of centrifugal force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mi>cf</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>dm</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mtext>&#952;&#969;</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>xcos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#977;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi></msubsup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>dx</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mi>ef</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mi>mg</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#964;</mi><mi>cf</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mg</mi><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"n